// Eonmark visuals: how each unit kind is drawn. Schema:
// crates/rules/src/visuals.rs (deny_unknown_fields). Keys are unit kind ids
// from rules/units.ron; every kind listed there must appear here (the loader
// rejects a missing or unknown key and names it). Loaded by rules::Rules::load,
// so this file is part of rules_hash; the sim never reads it. Building
// kinds join in M3b.
//
// M2: Primitive(Capsule | Cuboid | Cylinder | Sphere), sized from the kind's
//     radius_tiles_x100 and tinted with the owner's team colour.
// M7: Scene(path: "models/x.glb", scale_x100: 100, y_offset_tiles_x100: 0, yaw_deg: 0)
//     is parsed and validated now and used by the presenter from M7.
(
  units: {
    "yeoman": Primitive(Capsule),
    "scribe": Primitive(Cylinder),
    "skirmisher": Primitive(Cuboid),
  },
)
